(7747241, 1279566, 9668, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot of this historic cathedral. I can''t quite figure out the black dot texture in the sky.</td>', 'Beautiful shot of this historic cathedral. I can''t quite figure out the black dot texture in the sky.', '2023-06-02 04:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
